author olafsson <einar.olafsson@gmail.com> 1784610415 -0400
committer olafsson <einar.olafsson@gmail.com> 1784610415 -0400

test(qt): 46 pytest-qt tests covering theme, widgets, screens, bridge

* tests/qt/conftest.py    — offscreen QT platform, importorskip for
                             PySide6 + pytest-qt, session fixture
                             qt_theme_applied applying palette + QSS
* tests/qt/test_theme.py  — palette key set, hex color format, monotonic
                             spacing scale, stylesheet length + selector
                             coverage, apply_qpalette() ↔ PALETTE
* tests/qt/test_widgets.py — Card/Divider/Section/Tile/Toggle/UsageBar
                             construction, tile.clicked signal, toggle
                             on/off, UsageBar object name thresholds
* tests/qt/test_main_window.py — MainWindow constructs, navigation
                                  registers screens, Home returns to
                                  StartupPage; Sidebar and StartupPage
                                  emit their signals on click
* tests/qt/test_app_screen.py  — AppScreen builds for every runnable
                                  key, settings_model populates widgets,
                                  runnable-vs-interactive mapping
* tests/qt/test_bridge.py — StreamRedirector line-splitting, worker
                             success/exception flow, make_thread shape

Runs cleanly under QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen; skips gracefully if
PySide6 or pytest-qt is not installed.

